<div class="col-span-11 bg-content-bg p-4">
	  <h1>The Okinawan Karate Club of Madison</h1>
	  <h4><b>Martial arts training for adults and mature teens</b></h4>
	  <p>
		<b>The Okinawan Karate Club of Madison</b> practices traditional Okinawan Shorin Ryu
		karate as taught by <%= link_to "Eizo Shimabukuro O'Sensei", 
		"http://www.usadojo.com/eizo-shimabukuro/" %> and Okinawan Shudokan
		karate as taught by the late <%= link_to "Walter Todd Sensei",
		"http://www.koryu.com/library/mskoss10.html" %>. Our training emphasizes <%= link_to 'practical karate', :pages_practical %> suitable for life protection and self development.
	  </p>
	  <p><b>Complete karate instruction:</b></p>
	  <ul>
		<li>forms (kata)</li>
		<li>self-defense</li>
		<li>Okinawan weapons (kobudo)</li>
		<li>overall fitness and conditioning</li>
	  </ul>
	  <p>There are many additional benefits to karate training. As a dedicated student you can</p>
	  <ul>
		<li>improve strength and endurance</li>
		<li>develop better posture</li>
		<li>enhance focus and self discipline</li>
		<li>build confidence</li>
	  </ul>
	  <p>
			<%= link_to 'Try an upcoming class', :pages_classes %>! If you would like more information about training, please send e-mail to <%= render "layouts/email" %>.
	  </p>
	</div>
	<div class="col-span-11 col-end md:col-span-8 pt-4 md:pt-0">
		<div class="row-span-full">
			<div class="relative aspect-video mb-4">
				<iframe 
					class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full border-0"
					src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/mOwFY5ADbsI"
					title="YouTube video player"
					allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" 
					referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
					loading="lazy"
					allowfullscreen >
				</iframe>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="row-span-full">
			<%= render "layouts/contact" %>
		</div>
		<div class="row-span-full">
			<h3 class="text-xl font-bold block mb-2.5 border-b border-gray-400">Instructor</h3>
		</div>
		<div class="row-span-full">
			<%= image_tag "sensei.png", size: "115x153", alt: "Andrew de Laix Sensei" %>
		</div>
		<div class="row-span-full">
			<b>Andrew de Laix Sensei</b> holds the rank of Shodan in the Shobayashi Ryu and Shudokan 
			styles of karate. He is committed to teaching karate in the Okinawan tradition
			as a life-preserving art.
		</div>
	</div>
